  "durationSeconds": 69.4,
  "caption": "Isolate myself from everything ",
  "transcript": {
    "text": "I ain't going to lie. I have moments when I just isolate myself. Away from everybody, man. I do not answer the phone. I do not respond to nobody. I love when the world is quiet just for a little bit, you know? Cuz the world is always moving and it's always busy and I love my silence, I love my peace. So I ain't going to lie that DND be my best friend because man, I truly do use it. And some of my homies be like, yo you too good. You Hollywood now. And it's like no that's not the case at all whatsoever. It's just man I don't like my phone to vibrate. I don't like it when it goes off. It it kind of makes me anxious on the real. And it distracts me too. You know I could be focused on doing something and then my phone go off and all of a sudden, I'm on my phone, I'm scrolling on something I'm not even supposed to be scrolling on. So, I just have my phone on DND, you know. I just mind my own business and stay focused. I like it that way, and it's more peaceful because I am in control of my own energy, and I think that's how it should be.",
